        {"symbol": "AMZN", "price": "$201.70", "change": 0.56}, {"symbol": "BTC", "price": "$97.8k", "change": 2.08}
      ], "atWord": 1}, "source": "ILLUSTRATIVE — DEMO"}
    },
    {
      "id": "s03", "type": "CANDLESTICK", "narration": "Zoom into one name and each day becomes a candle: open, high, low, close, with the average trending up.",
