        {"open": 103, "high": 114, "low": 102, "close": 112, "label": "Wed"},
        {"open": 112, "high": 118, "low": 108, "close": 110, "label": "Thu"},
        {"open": 110, "high": 122, "low": 109, "close": 120, "label": "Fri"}
      ], "ma": [102, 104, 107, 110, 113]}, "source": "ILLUSTRATIVE — DEMO"}
    },
    {
      "id": "s04", "type": "LINE_CHART", "narration": "Pull back to quarters and the trend is clear: revenue climbing while costs stay flat.",
      "durationFrames": 210, "timingSource": "estimated", "background": "zoneA", "transition": "morph",
      "data": {"headline": "Revenue [outran] costs.", "headlineColor": "green", "lineChart": {"series": [
        {"label": "Revenue", "color": "green", "values": [12, 20, 34, 52]},
        {"label": "Costs", "color": "red", "values": [18, 22, 24, 27]}
      ], "xAxis": ["Q1", "Q2", "Q3", "Q4"], "yMax": 60, "area": true, "atWord": 1}, "source": "ILLUSTRATIVE — DEMO"}
    },
    {
      "id": "s05", "type": "STAT_CALLOUT", "narration": "Add it up and the headline number is a big one: nineteen billion dollars in contracted revenue.",
      "durationFrames": 190, "timingSource": "estimated", "background": "zoneB", "transition": "wipe",
      "data": {"value": 19, "prefix": "$", "suffix": "B", "label": "contracted revenue over the term", "atWord": 11}
    },
    {
      "id": "s06", "type": "WATERFALL", "narration": "But gross is not net: start at revenue, add upsell, subtract churn and refunds, and land on the bottom line.",
      "durationFrames": 240, "timingSource": "estimated", "background": "zoneC", "transition": "push",
      "data": {"headline": "The [revenue] bridge.", "headlineColor": "green", "waterfallChart": {"color": "green", "unit": "k", "bars": [
        {"label": "Revenue", "value": 500, "isTotal": true, "atWord": 4},
        {"label": "Upsell", "value": 220, "color": "green", "atWord": 7},
        {"label": "Churn", "value": -140, "color": "red", "atWord": 9},
        {"label": "Refunds", "value": -45, "color": "red", "atWord": 11},
        {"label": "Net", "value": 0, "isTotal": true, "atWord": 15}
      ]}, "source": "ILLUSTRATIVE — DEMO"}
    },
    {
      "id": "s07", "type": "SANKEY", "narration": "Follow the cash and it splits: some to salaries, some to growth, and the rest to profit.",
      "durationFrames": 240, "timingSource": "estimated", "background": "zoneA", "transition": "slide",
      "data": {"headline": "Where the [money] goes.", "headlineColor": "blue", "sankey": {"color": "blue", "unit": "k", "nodes": [
